    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A wicked Spider that once lived in the Wastelands while Beleth was free. After Beleth was sealed away, the Spider was chased away by a colony of Ants, empowered by M. Atk. of the Wastelands. The Spider was forced to retreat to this place. It swears that someday it will feed on the Ants and destroy them. It quietly grows in power while sharpening its fangs for vengeance. Bugs Lv. 12 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Bugs. Speed +5 Evasion +5 P. Skill Evasion +3% M. Skill Evasion +3% Resistance to Spear +10% Max HP -5% Resistance to Fire -10% Resistance to Fist -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
